OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,FSouthampton boss Tonda Eckert has
OL,8,Favoided major punishment for his role
OL,9,Fin 'Spygate' after the Football
OL,10,FAssociation (FA) handed him a
OL,11,Fsuspended six-week ban.
OL,13,FThe 33-year-old, who was also fined
OL,14,F#28,000, attended an FA hearing at the
OL,15,Fstart of the international break and
OL,16,Fis able to continue his role against
OL,17,Frivals Portsmouth this Sunday and
OL,18,Fbeyond.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
