PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,FSaints were kicked out of last
OL,8,Fseason's Championship play-off final
OL,9,Fand docked four points this term.
OL,11,FIt came after the club admitted three
OL,12,Fbreaches of EFL regulations, having
OL,13,Fbeing caught snooping on semi-final
OL,14,Fopponents Middlesbrough and two other
OL,15,Fteams.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
