FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,FEckert accepted full responsibility
OL,8,Fand was charged by the FA with three
OL,9,Fbreaches of Rule E3.1 in relation to
OL,10,F"misconduct", which hung over
OL,11,FSouthampton and their manager heading
OL,12,Finto the new campaign.
OL,14,FThe suspended ban will remain in place
OL,15,Funtil the end of next season.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,FAn FA statement read: "Tonda Eckert
OL,8,Fsubsequently admitted the charges, and
OL,9,Fan independent Regulatory Commission
OL,10,Fimposed a six-week suspension from all
OL,11,Ffootball and football related
OL,12,Factivity, which is suspended until the
OL,13,Fend of the 2027/28 season, a #28,000
OL,14,Ffine and a reprimand following a
OL,15,Fhearing.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,F"The suspended sanction will come into
OL,8,Feffect in the event he is found to
OL,9,Fhave committed a breach of Rules or
OL,10,FRegulations by requesting,
OL,11,Fauthorising, taking, or using
OL,12,Finformation from any observation of
OL,13,Fthe training of another club, in
OL,14,Fwhatever guise that observation may
OL,15,Ftake."
OL,17,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
