PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,FThe punishment is likely to draw
OL,8,Fstrong opinions from across the game,
OL,9,Fwith Southampton saying in a statement
OL,10,F"this now brings a conclusion to a
OL,11,Fregrettable period of our history".
OL,13,FThe club, who sit 13th in the
OL,14,FChampionship, say "measures have been
OL,15,Fput in place to ensure that such
OL,16,Ferrors in judgement never happen again
OL,17,Fat our club" and they are "excited to
OL,18,Fmove forward together towards a bright
OL,19,Ffuture".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,FSouthampton owner Dragan Solak said:
OL,8,F"I'm pleased that the independent
OL,9,Fpanel has come to a decision and that
OL,10,Fwe have an outcome.
OL,12,F"We have already suffered enough, and
OL,13,Fwe appreciate the panel's recognition
OL,14,Fof that.
OL,16,F"We are confident the manager has
OL,17,Flearned from this matter, and a
OL,18,Fsuspended sentence allows him to
OL,19,Fcontinue in his role.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,F"I firmly believe that Tonda is one of
OL,8,FEurope's most exciting young coaches,
OL,9,Fand with this distraction removed, I
OL,10,Fam confident he can lead the team to a
OL,11,Fsuccessful season.
OL,13,F"I'd like to thank our fans for
OL,14,Fstanding by us and showing the team so
OL,15,Fmuch support during a time when we
OL,16,Fhave needed them more than ever.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,F"The FA process has been a positive
OL,8,Fexperience. Tonda has been given the
OL,9,Fopportunity to be open and honest with
OL,10,Fthe panel, and the panel has been able
OL,11,Fto see that he is simply a good person
OL,12,Fwho made poor decisions.
OL,14,F"The same cannot be said for the
OL,15,FEnglish Football League (EFL) process,
OL,16,Fand the way they have subsequently
OL,17,Ftreated us is not something we will
OL,18,Fforget.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791571696
OL,3,CSouthampton boss Eckert handed
OL,4,Csuspended six-week ban over 'Spygate'
OL,5,Cscandal
OL,7,F"However, now is the time to look
OL,8,Fforward to what I believe will be a
OL,9,Fgreat future for our club."
OL,11,FThe EFL declined to comment.
